# phase3_headless_ci.re - Phase 3 Pack D headless CI gate.
# Module: demo (antinomia script).
# Owns: init -> wait -> triage-live -> kill via headless JSON exit.
# Depends: antinomia CLI. @INFERIOR@ substituted at configure time.

init @INFERIOR@
wait_event 5000
wait_event 5000
triage-live --limit 8
state --limit 4
kill
